      </p>
      <div class="bg-lotus-white rounded-lg shadow-airbnb p-8 space-y-6">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
          <div class="w-32 h-12 bg-rausch rounded-[16px] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-rausch-dark hover:scale-105 shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-semibold cursor-pointer">
